T1  - D3Fuzz: Dynamic, directed and decaying LLM-driven fuzzing for deep learning libraries
AU  - Sun, Jiaze
AU  - Dong, Jiayao
AU  - Zhang, Hengshan
AU  - Tian, Zhenzhou
AU  - Zhang, Yadong
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 199
